<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Hi <%= @user.username %>,</p>

    <p>
      A passkey named <strong><%= @passkey.nickname %></strong> was added to your vglist account on
      <%= @passkey.created_at.utc.strftime('%B %-d, %Y at %H:%M UTC') %>. It can be used to sign in instead of your password.
    </p>

    <p>If this was you, there's nothing else to do.</p>

    <p>
      If it wasn't, change your password and remove the passkey in your
      <%= link_to 'account settings', @settings_url %>.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
